{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28183","headline":"哀蜀人爲南蛮俘虏五章 别巂州一时恸哭云日爲之变色 · 雍陶","name":"哀蜀人爲南蛮俘虏五章 别巂州一时恸哭云日爲之变色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越巂城南无汉地，伤心从此便爲蛮。\n冤声一恸悲风起，云暗青天日下山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}